							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "gD7gMNC6SEOHcprPNwVjHw=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "*Cheap visualizations*\nCheap navigable views (visualizations) in GT.\nMost views are simple, textual. But graphical views are also possible.\n(Which kinds to show?)\n(What domain would be good to use as a running example?)\n\n*AI generation*\nHow AI can generate views.\nWhat about Mondrian-style visualizations? Can AI generate these autonomously?\nCan the AI judge what kind of visualization is needed for a given question?\n\n*Verification and Trust*\nThe end result must be navigable and verifiable.\nShow how we can turn the chat into an explorable artifact — we can judge what the AI is doing.\n\n\n*AI interpretation*\nShow how an AI can interpret a view/visualization."
						}
					]
				},
